1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,677
The queen is bait in this famous opening trap.

2
00:00:03,757 --> 00:00:07,434
White develops quickly while Black brings out the bishop.

3
00:00:07,514 --> 00:00:11,191
The knight jumps into the center with a hidden idea.

4
00:00:11,271 --> 00:00:14,949
Black captures the queen and thinks the game is over.

5
00:00:15,029 --> 00:00:18,706
But the bishop check drags the king onto a dangerous square.

6
00:00:18,786 --> 00:00:22,463
The final knight move closes every escape square.

7
00:00:22,543 --> 00:00:26,220
Legal's Mate: never grab material before checking the attack.
